id: rejuvenating-light
name: Rejuvenating Light
kind: crafting
special: true
categoriesExcept: weights
slots: 1
source: Divinity Unleashed
description: >
  Using a Surge Maneuver: 3(bT) Divine Ki Points back.
summary: >
  [Triggered]: If you use a Surge Maneuver, regain 3(bT) Divine Ki Points.
text: >
  Rejuvenating Light: The power that flows through you restores your divine energy.
  –Apparel Category: All (except Weights)
  –Prerequisites: Divinity Unleashed
  –Quality Slots: 1
  –Effects: If you use a Surge Maneuver, regain 3(bT) Divine Ki Points.

---

# The Surge Maneuver used - a Healing or a Ki Surge through it.
[automatic/healing-surge]
requires bySurgeManeuver;
divineKi.value += 3(bT);

[automatic/ki-surge]
requires bySurgeManeuver;
divineKi.value += 3(bT);
